OL,3,GNEWSAFire service warning after reports
OL,4,Aof impersonator
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service has issued a warning to
OL,7,Fhomeowners after reports of a person in
OL,8,Funiform claiming to offer "safe and
OL,9,Fwell" visits.
OL,11,FSurrey Fire and Rescue Service (SFRS)
OL,12,Fsaid all its home visits would be
OL,13,Fpre-arranged, free of charge and
OL,14,Fcarried out by staff and crews in
OL,15,Funiform and with ID.
OL,17,FTarina Webber, fire prevention officer
OL,18,Fand safeguarding manager at SFRS, said
OL,19,Fthe service was liaising with police
OL,20,Fover the issue, reported in the
OL,21,FFordbridge area of Spelthorne.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
